From a202deec92aebc8f2bb3eb45ab0249e5c2df2798 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gz <gz@local>
Date: Sat, 27 Jun 2026 20:15:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Enhance scenario1/2 demos, verify tooling, and bump lvgl
 submodule.

Add three-row side peek tiles, 3D ray pick, fullscreen hide via mesh opa,
scenario2 segment-pool parallax, GPU path verify stats, and enable snapshot
plus segment pool in backend configs.
